{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CiYTQHPBHPbvh8UdETZGyx","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (30.8KB). Full output saved to: /ard-home/.claude/projects/-Users-al--ard-work-albertcbrown-ard-01M87JEJGXM6G2MR03YGCK01QJ/583af8df-a35c-4979-8568-c1793d0cecc8/tool-results/bq4v2saqr.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n3:# first, with an annotated tag and a notes-only release. It never moves or\n26:        description: Plan only; create no tag or release\n34:concurrency:\n35:  group: version-main\n76:          # \"tag\" or \"backfill\" (a release for an existing tag).\n216:              fail \"no version tag: create the annotated seed tag v0.1.0 (docs/runbooks/release.md)\"\n218:            echo \"::notice title=version::no version tag yet; nothing to plan until an admin creates the annotated seed tag v0.1.0 (docs/runbooks/release.md)\"\n219:            write_summary \"No version tag yet: create the annotated seed tag v0.1.0 (docs/runbooks/release.md).\"\n236:          # A tag without a release: the seed tag, or a run that died between\n237:          # pushing a tag and creating its release.\n238:          api \"repos/$REPO/releases/tags/$base_tag\"\n241:            rows+=(\"| \\`${base:0:12}\\` | $base_tag | release only | |\")\n242:            echo \"$base -> $base_tag (release backfill)\"\n363:    environment: release\n376:          app-id: ${{ vars.RELEASE_APP_ID }}\n377:          private-key: ${{ secrets.RELEASE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY }}\n386:          TAGGER_NAME: ${{ vars.RELEASE_BOT_NAME }}\n387:          TAGGER_EMAIL: ${{ vars.RELEASE_BOT_EMAIL }}\n424:            fail \"refusing to tag: the release App must not be ard's App ($BOT_LOGIN)\"\n428:            fail \"refusing to tag: set the RELEASE_BOT_NAME and RELEASE_BOT_EMAIL repository variables\"\n459:          # Notes: the tag message body and the release notes. The title is\n525:              gh release create \"$ver\" --verify-tag --title \"$ver\" --n