wn/ard/issues/178)) writes the user documentation and publishes it as a GitHub Pages site, and Phase 5 ([#177](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/issues/177)) publishes versioned releases and a Homebrew cask (`brew install --cask albertcbrown/tap/ard`).\n57:deploy/test-*.sh            chart, image and repo checks for the above (`make chart-test`, `make image-test`); test-release.sh is `make release-check`\n58:.goreleaser.yaml            GoReleaser v2 config: four-target archives, checksums and the Homebrew cask (checked by `make release-check`)\n4:.PHONY: build test lint fmt clean cve-fixtures lts-fixtures lint-scanner-fixtures chart-test image-test agent-image agent-image-test docs-check release-check\n5-\n6-build:\n7-\tCGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags \"$(LDFLAGS)\" -o bin/ard ./cmd/ard\n8-\n9-test:\n10-\tgo test ./...\n--\n62:docs-check:\n63-\tmkdocs build --strict -d /tmp/ard-site\n64-\tgo test ./internal/docscheck/...\n65-\n66-# Validates .goreleaser.yaml and builds a snapshot release of all four targets\n67-# (needs goreleaser v2 and python3; not part of `make test`).\n68-release-check:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013hMzwT5tgUHCjtfybDw9A8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
